        "response": {
          "bodySize": 45142,
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 45142,
            "text": "{\"events\":[{\"id\":\"68f12b767d686246fda545c2\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"THE FINANCE CURSE: Sands Films Cinema Club online presentation\",\"description\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">This page is to obtain access to the broadcast of this Sands Films Cinema Club presentation</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">To attend in person in our cinema, please<a href=\\\"https://sandsfilms.eventive.org/schedule/683429d6ee36afd29a0ecaf5\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"> </a><a href=\\\"https://sandsfilms.eventive.org/schedule\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(240, 102, 102);\\\"><strong>CLICK HERE</strong></a></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">*</p><h1 class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">THE FINANCE CURSE</h1><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>SPECIAL PREVIEW</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><span class=\\\"ql-size-huge\\\">with Q&amp;A</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong>The Finance Curse is the first documentary to expose the blood and guts of financialisation, the human cost and how we can make finance our servant, not our master.</strong></p><p><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>Join us for a feedback session on our current rough-cut of the film, with the directors/producers. You'll be given a feedback form to fill out at the end of the doc, followed by a discussion session.</strong></p>\",\"short_description\":\"documentary Financialisation\",\"venue\":{},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2025-10-27T19:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2025-10-27T21:00:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6212329f6ee92e007e8874e6\",\"name\":\"Documentary\",\"color\":\"#7296ee\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"trailer_url\":\"\",\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":true,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity\":0,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"68f12b767d686246fda545c3\",\"name\":\"Watch online, Please make a donation to help us cover costs.\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity_sold\":2,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":9007199254740991,\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"max_quantity_per_person\":null,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"68f12b767d686246fda545c9\",\"type\":\"livestream\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"Sands Films Studio\",\"owner_id\":\"60b1303f5955f7009b7cdff3\",\"name\":\"THE FINANCE CURSE: Sands Films Cinema Club online presentation\",\"sort_key\":\"FINANCE CURSE: Sands Films Cinema Club online presentation, THE\",\"short_description\":\"documentary Financialisation\",\"unballoted\":true,\"details\":{},\"credits\":{},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"virtual_content\":{\"id\":\"68f12b767d686246fda545cb\",\"type\":\"livestream\",\"status\":\"livestream_not_created\",\"export_status\":\"export_not_requested\",\"livestream_ingest_urls\":[],\"livestream_preview_first\":true,\"livestream_transcription_enabled\":false,\"livestream_premium_enabled\":false,\"live_chat_visible\":true,\"live_chat_participation_enabled\":true,\"live_chat_show_viewer_count\":true,\"ams_drm_enabled\":false,\"created_at\":\"2025-10-16T17:29:26.431Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-10-16T17:29:26.431Z\",\"platform\":\"eventive\",\"caption_tracks\":[]},\"start_time\":\"2025-11-11T20:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2025-11-11T22:55:00.000Z\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-16T17:29:26.424Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-10-16T17:29:26.424Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true,\"livestream_mode\":\"embedded\",\"livestream_embed_code\":\"<div itemscope itemtype=\\\"https://schema.org/VideoObject\\\" style=\\\"position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%;\\\"><meta itemprop=\\\"name\\\" content=\\\"Sands Films Virtual Cinema Club\\\" /><meta itemprop=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"This is the live stream from Sands Films Cinema Club\\\" /><meta itemprop=\\\"uploadDate\\\" content=\\\"2025-02-08T16:32:16.000Z\\\" /><meta itemprop=\\\"thumbnailUrl\\\" content=\\\"https://s1.dmcdn.net/v/Xq6H81eP52agERzQ2/x180\\\" /><meta itemprop=\\\"embedUrl\\\" content=\\\"https://geo.dailymotion.com/player/x15jgk.html?video=x9drbk8\\\" /><iframe frameborder=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:100%;position:absolute;left:0px;top:0px;overflow:hidden;\\\" src=\\\"https://geo.dailymotion.com/player/x15jgk.html?video=x9drbk8&playlist=x7ilc3\\\" allowfullscreen allow=\\\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; web-share\\\" title=\\\"Dailymotion video player – Sands Films Virtual Cinema Club\\\"></iframe></div>\"}],\"updated_at\":\"2025-10-17T10:47:05.708Z\",\"is_virtual\":true,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":true,\"allow_preorder\":true,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_closed\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"virtual_balloting_consolidated\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":false,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":false,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":false,\"virtual_show_donate_prompt\":true,\"virtual_donate_message\":\"Support Sands Films Cinema Club and help cover our costs with an optional donation.\",\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[{\"url\":null,\"image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/5337acef3a0df6cf398f764240a36420.png\"}],\"images\":{\"still\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/17606358425224b22cd4de92e03ed648c.jpg\"},\"custom_email_text\":\"<p><strong>Thank you for booking this online presentation.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>The link will be live some 15 minutes before the advertised time; it will remain active for 7 days for you to complete watching.</strong></p><p><strong>The Cinema Club has an alternative back up stream here: </strong><a href=\\\"https://www.sandsfilms.co.uk/the-cinema-club/next-screening-watch-live.html\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><strong>https://www.sandsfilms.co.uk/the-cinema-club/next-screening-watch-live.html</strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Please feel free to send feedbacks, comments or complaints:</u> filmclub@sandsfilms.co.uk</strong></p>\",\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[]},{\"id\":\"68d3c03e18bf5d4aef3e88a6\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"SANKARA'S ORPHANS (Les Orphelins de Sankara)\",\"description\":\"<p><span class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\">﻿This page is to book seats in our cinema (in person attendance). This presentation is also available as a broadcast to watch LIVE or later (on line attendance)</span><a href=\\\"https://watch.eventive.org/sandsfilms/play/68c340b4c9ccc8ec0bdc19cf\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\"> </a><a href=\\\"https://watch.eventive.org/sandsfilms/play/68d4314be3a9a5defb36cc7b\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\\\"><strong>CLICK HERE TO ATTEND THE VIRTUAL SCREENING</strong></a><a href=\\\"https://watch.eventive.org/sandsfilms/play/68d4314be3a9a5defb36cc7b\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\"> </a></p><p><br></p><h1 class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">SANKARA'S ORPHANS (Les Orphelins de Sankara)</h1><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\">Organised in partnership with North London Cuba Solidarity Campaign</strong></p><p><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-justify\\\"><span class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\">a film by Géraldine Berger&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-justify\\\"><span class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\">In 1986, 600 orphans and rural children from Burkina-Faso were sent to Cuba with the mission of learning a trade so they could come back and develop their country, which was undergoing a Revolution. But after the assassination in 1987 of President Thomas Sankara, the liquidation of the Revolution by Blaise Compaoré and the end of the Cold War, how were they to return, to build themselves, to exist? The narrative of this utopia of Red Africa and the epic memories of these children are mixed with the archive images, sometimes reddened by the sand, the heat and the wind, sometimes faded, almost disappearing, thus giving us to see the reminiscences of their revolutionary youth.</span></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-justify\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p>\",\"short_description\":\"Documentary about children from Burkina-Faso sent to Cuba\",\"location\":\"Sands Films Cinema\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"616324bd6f5b7b00459ce70e\",\"name\":\"Sands Films Cinema\",\"short_name\":\"Sands Cinema\",\"description\":\"Film preview theatre\",\"address\":\"82 St Marychurch Street\\nLondon, SE16 4HZ\",\"default_capacity\":null,\"color\":\"#23a833\",\"use_reserved_seating\":false,\"comscore_include\":true},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2025-11-04T20:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2025-11-04T22:00:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6212329f6ee92e007e8874e6\",\"name\":\"Documentary\",\"color\":\"#7296ee\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"trailer_url\":\"https://youtu.be/URWJhZnv9XE?si=GC5DPipYcvIfr5F9\",\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":true,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity\":63,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"68d3c03e18bf5d4aef3e88a7\",\"name\":\"No charge to reserve seat, instead, please make a donation to support our work and contribute to our costs.\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":63,\"quantity_sold\":39,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":24,\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"max_quantity_per_person\":3,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true},{\"id\":\"68d3c03e18bf5d4aef3e88a8\",\"name\":\"\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity_sold\":0,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":9007199254740991,\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[\"653a28fed93ee8007364add5\"],\"is_active\":true}],\"films\":[],\"updated_at\":\"2025-09-24T18:02:09.237Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{\"cover\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/17587365285480a7e11e069543efce6a7.jpg\",\"avatar\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1758736528552b7b3f6c236d88f5149ff.jpg\"},\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[]},{\"id\":\"68f12a6ffe0ae978ec00d96d\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"THE FINANCE CURSE\",\"description\":\"<p><span class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\">﻿This page is to book seats in our cinema (in person attendance). This presentation can be watched LIVE  </span>But viewers will not be able to rewind or fast-forward. If viewers join late, they will miss the beginning of the program. When the presentation has finished, the program will&nbsp;end and no longer be accessible to anyone.<a href=\\\"https://watch.eventive.org/sandsfilms/play/68c340b4c9ccc8ec0bdc19cf\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\"> </a><a href=\\\"https://watch.eventive.org/sandsfilms/play/68f12b767d686246fda545c2\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\\\"><strong>CLICK HERE TO ATTEND THE VIRTUAL SCREENING</strong></a><a href=\\\"https://watch.eventive.org/sandsfilms/play/68f12b767d686246fda545c2\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\"> </a></p><p><br></p><h1 class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">THE FINANCE CURSE</h1><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\">SPECIAL PREVIEW of the rough cut</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">with Q&amp;A</p><p><br></p><p><strong class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\">The Finance Curse is the first documentary to expose the blood and guts of financialisation, the human cost and how we can make finance our servant, not our master.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\">Join us for a feedback session on our current rough-cut of the film, with the directors/producers. You'll be given a feedback form to fill out at the end of the doc, followed by a discussion session.</strong></p>\",\"short_description\":\"Documentary about financialisation\",\"location\":\"Sands Films Cinema\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"616324bd6f5b7b00459ce70e\",\"name\":\"Sands Films Cinema\",\"short_name\":\"Sands Cinema\",\"description\":\"Film preview theatre\",\"address\":\"82 St Marychurch Street\\nLondon, SE16 4HZ\",\"default_capacity\":null,\"color\":\"#23a833\",\"use_reserved_seating\":false,\"comscore_include\":true},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2025-11-11T20:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2025-11-11T22:00:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6212329f6ee92e007e8874e6\",\"name\":\"Documentary\",\"color\":\"#7296ee\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"trailer_url\":\"\",\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":true,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity\":63,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"68f12a6ffe0ae978ec00d96e\",\"name\":\"No charge to reserve seat, instead, please make a donation to support our work and contribute to our costs.\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":63,\"quantity_sold\":18,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":45,\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"max_quantity_per_person\":3,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true},{\"id\":\"68f12a6ffe0ae978ec00d96f\",\"name\":\"\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity_sold\":0,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":9007199254740991,\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[\"653a28fed93ee8007364add5\"],\"is_active\":true}],\"films\":[],\"updated_at\":\"2025-10-17T10:49:46.925Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{\"cover\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/17606356571820afa22b9f596c4499696.jpg\",\"avatar\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1760635657171bef47e4921e86164bd50.jpg\"},\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[]},{\"id\":\"68d4fb2d2428deee73a9799b\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"The Tank and the Olive Tree: Sands Films Cinema Club online presentation\",\"description\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">This page is to obtain access to the broadcast of this Sands Films Cinema Club presentation</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">To attend in person in our cinema, please<a href=\\\"https://sandsfilms.eventive.org/schedule/683429d6ee36afd29a0ecaf5\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"> </a><a href=\\\"https://sandsfilms.eventive.org/schedule\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(240, 102, 102);\\\"><strong>CLICK HERE</strong></a></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">*</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>LONDON PALESTINE FILM FESTIVAL 2025</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>NOVEMBER 14 - 28</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><a href=\\\"https://www.palestinefilm.org.uk/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 242);\\\"><strong>FULL LISTING OF THE FESTIVAL CLICK HERE</strong></a></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">London Palestine Film Festival (LPFF) was established in the late 90s and continued to run until it took a hiatus in 2014. The festival returned bigger and better in 2018.</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">Sands Films Cinema Club are proud to make a small contribution to the London Palestine Festival by screening two documentaries by French filmmaker Roland Nurier.</p><p><br></p><p><a href=\\\"https://sandsfilms.eventive.org/films/68d4f0b113b8fde6b62d5848\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 242);\\\"><img src=\\\"https://static-a.eventive.org/471d96758df78ca65b1c350cd0dd97ce.jpg?w=300\\\" style=\\\"border-radius: 0.1rem; display: block; height: auto; max-width: 100%; width: 170px;\\\"></a></p><h2>The Tank and the Olive Tree, Another History of Palestine</h2><p>The Tank and The Olive Tree recalls a certain number of forgotten fundamentals and sheds new light on the history of Palestine. By combining geopolitical analysis, interviews with international personalities who are experts on the subject and testimonies from Palestinian and French citizens, this documentary offers the keys to understanding what the media call the Israeli-Palestinian conflict. Enough to rid people's minds of clichés and prejudices! If The Chariot and the Olivier is intended to be educational, it speaks above all of a magnificent territory, and of a people who constantly affirm that “to live is already to resist”...</p><p><br></p><p><em>Tue, Nov 18th, 8:00 PM @ Sands Films Cinema</em></p><ul><li><em>Year:</em></li></ul><p>2019</p>\",\"short_description\":\"Part of the London Palestine Film Festival 2025\",\"venue\":{},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2025-11-18T19:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2025-12-05T21:00:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6212329f6ee92e007e8874e6\",\"name\":\"Documentary\",\"color\":\"#7296ee\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false