5defb36cc7b\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"ql-size-large\\\"> </a></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p>\",\"short_description\":\"Screening part of London Palestine Film Festival 2025\",\"location\":\"Sands Films Cinema\",\"venue\":{\"id\":\"616324bd6f5b7b00459ce70e\",\"name\":\"Sands Films Cinema\",\"short_name\":\"Sands Cinema\",\"description\":\"Film preview theatre\",\"address\":\"82 St Marychurch Street\\nLondon, SE16 4HZ\",\"default_capacity\":null,\"color\":\"#23a833\",\"use_reserved_seating\":false,\"comscore_include\":true},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2025-11-18T20:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2025-11-18T22:00:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6212329f6ee92e007e8874e6\",\"name\":\"Documentary\",\"color\":\"#7296ee\",\"visible\":true}],\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"hide_tickets_button\":false,\"require_mailing_address\":false,\"require_phone_number\":false,\"rush_line_enabled\":true,\"passholder_ticket_required\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_enabled\":true,\"standalone_ticket_sales_unlocked\":false,\"sales_disabled_unless_coupon\":false,\"trailer_url\":\"https://youtu.be/URWJhZnv9XE?si=GC5DPipYcvIfr5F9\",\"disable_pass_quick_order\":false,\"credits_disabled\":true,\"tickets_available\":true,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity\":63,\"ticket_buckets\":[{\"id\":\"68d4f65068630e978444276b\",\"name\":\"No charge to reserve seat, instead, please make a donation to support our work and contribute to our costs.\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":false,\"quantity\":63,\"quantity_sold\":58,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":5,\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"max_quantity_per_person\":3,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[],\"is_active\":true},{\"id\":\"68d4f65068630e978444276c\",\"name\":\"\",\"price\":0,\"unlimited\":true,\"quantity_sold\":0,\"quantity_scanned\":0,\"quantity_remaining\":9007199254740991,\"public\":true,\"autoissue_companion_ticket\":[],\"exclude_capacity\":false,\"lock_admin_only\":false,\"variable_price\":false,\"variable_price_minimum\":0,\"variants\":[],\"applicable_pass_buckets\":[\"653a28fed93ee8007364add5\"],\"is_active\":true}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"68d4f0b113b8fde6b62d5848\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"Sands Films Studio\",\"owner_id\":\"60b1303f5955f7009b7cdff3\",\"name\":\"The Tank and the Olive Tree, Another History of Palestine\",\"sort_key\":\"Tank and the Olive Tree, Another History of Palestine, The\",\"description\":\"The Tank and The Olive Tree recalls a certain number of forgotten fundamentals and sheds new light on the history of Palestine. By combining geopolitical analysis, interviews with international personalities who are experts on the subject and testimonies from Palestinian and French citizens, this documentary offers the keys to understanding what the media call the Israeli-Palestinian conflict. Enough to rid people's minds of clichés and prejudices! If The Chariot and the Olivier is intended to be educational, it speaks above all of a magnificent territory, and of a people who constantly affirm that “to live is already to resist”...\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/7d6362a8b11d9034e0890382907ed59f.jpg?fit=crop&w=960&h=380\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/471d96758df78ca65b1c350cd0dd97ce.jpg?w=300\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/d01f6203bfd93430790a588a78dfaa71.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"language\":\"French\",\"runtime\":\"101\",\"year\":\"2019\"},\"credits\":{\"animator\":null,\"cast\":\"Vera Baboun, Gilles Devers, Richard Falk\",\"cinematographer\":\"Jérémie Baré\",\"co_producer\":null,\"composer\":null,\"director\":\"Roland Nurier\",\"editor\":\"Rémi Boria\",\"executive_producer\":null,\"filmmaker\":null,\"music\":null,\"producer\":\"Yoann Nurier\",\"production_design\":null,\"screenwriter\":\"Roland Nurier\",\"sound_design\":null},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[],\"imdb_id\":\"tt11187404\",\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2025-09-25T07:35:13.538Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-09-25T07:35:29.935Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true},{\"id\":\"68d4ef17467dba04200a1eec\",\"type\":\"film\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"event_bucket_name\":\"Sands Films Studio\",\"owner_id\":\"60b1303f5955f7009b7cdff3\",\"name\":\"London Palestine Film Festival 2025\",\"sort_key\":\"London Palestine Film Festival 2025\",\"description\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>LONDON PALESTINE FILM FESTIVAL 2025</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>NOVEMBER 14 - 28</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><a href=\\\"https://www.palestinefilm.org.uk\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><strong>FULL LISTING OF THE FESTIVAL CLICK HERE</strong></a></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">London Palestine Film Festival (LPFF) was established in the late 90s and continued to run until it took a hiatus in 2014. The festival returned bigger and better in 2018.</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">Sands Films Cinema Club are proud to make a small contribution to the London Palestine Festival by screening two documentaries by French filmmaker Roland Nurier.</p>\",\"cover_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/17587875040984bd5990b3d6ffb3ad120.jpg\",\"poster_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1758785620813e7d387221de3299d1b4a.jpg\",\"still_image\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/17587856352519230df70bd45031af0bd.jpg\",\"unballoted\":false,\"details\":{\"year\":\"2025\"},\"credits\":{},\"expanded_credits\":[],\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"66fd457865cb3f003a8b44b2\",\"name\":\"Palestine & Middle East\",\"color\":\"#fffc36\",\"visible\":true},{\"id\":\"66fd459245ac6a0099e8c4f6\",\"name\":\"Special Event\",\"color\":\"#7fff36\",\"visible\":true}],\"comscore_include\":true,\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"created_at\":\"2025-09-25T07:28:23.816Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-09-25T08:05:04.253Z\",\"_use_beta_vod_flow_for_new_virtual_content\":true}],\"updated_at\":\"2025-09-25T08:27:36.098Z\",\"is_virtual\":false,\"comscore_include\":true,\"geographic_restrictions\":[],\"geographic_exclusions\":[],\"vague_geographic_restrictions\":false,\"show_in_coming_soon\":false,\"allow_preorder\":false,\"aarp_member_required\":false,\"show_quantity_countdown\":false,\"virtual_balloting_enabled\":false,\"virtual_balloting_inline_during_playback\":false,\"use_default_event_bucket_preroll\":true,\"virtual_content_preroll\":[],\"virtual_content_preroll_visible\":true,\"use_default_event_bucket_postroll\":true,\"virtual_content_postroll\":[],\"virtual_content_postroll_visible\":true,\"virtual_intervals\":null,\"display_ads\":[],\"images\":{\"cover\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1758787285576f711d334de8f90f530a9.jpg\",\"avatar\":\"https://static-a.eventive.org/1758787285580229f71ea5bdcc3039239.jpg\"},\"ledger_tags\":[],\"rules\":[]},{\"id\":\"68d4fa2a0d3e6d059485555c\",\"event_bucket\":\"6161a93f49ddeb00acf3f48c\",\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"name\":\"Yallah Gaza: Sands Films Cinema Club online presentation\",\"description\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">This page is to obtain access to the broadcast of this Sands Films Cinema Club presentation</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">To attend in person in our cinema, please<a href=\\\"https://sandsfilms.eventive.org/schedule/683429d6ee36afd29a0ecaf5\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"> </a><a href=\\\"https://sandsfilms.eventive.org/schedule\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(240, 102, 102);\\\"><strong>CLICK HERE</strong></a></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">*</p><p><br></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>LONDON PALESTINE FILM FESTIVAL 2025</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><strong>NOVEMBER 14 - 28</strong></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><a href=\\\"https://www.palestinefilm.org.uk/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 242);\\\"><strong>FULL LISTING OF THE FESTIVAL CLICK HERE</strong></a></p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">London Palestine Film Festival (LPFF) was established in the late 90s and continued to run until it took a hiatus in 2014. The festival returned bigger and better in 2018.</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\">Sands Films Cinema Club are proud to make a small contribution to the London Palestine Festival by screening two documentaries by French filmmaker Roland Nurier.</p><p class=\\\"ql-align-center\\\"><br></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\\\"https://sandsfilms.eventive.org/films/68d4f0954a3cb4d4fa5edba6\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 242);\\\"><img src=\\\"https://static-a.eventive.org/66477c75e21fbbf6d1688ad94dd79f2d.jpg?w=300\\\" style=\\\"border-radius: 0.1rem; display: block; height: auto; max-width: 100%; width: 170px;\\\"></a></p><h2>Yallah Gaza</h2><p>Gaza is a small palestinian territory where more than 2 millions people live. Completely locked up by Israel since 2007, its society is still structured and organized, but for how many more times ?</p><p><a href=\\\"https://sandsfilms.eventive.org/films/68d4f0954a3cb4d4fa5edba6\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 242);\\\"><strong>MORE DETAILS</strong></a></p><p><strong>Showings</strong></p><p><em>Tue, Nov 25th, 8:00 PM @ Sands Films Cinema</em></p><ul><li><em>Year:</em></li><li>2023</li><li><em>Runtime:</em></li><li>101&nbsp;minutes</li><li><em>Language:</em></li><li>Arabic, English, French</li><li><em>Director:</em></li><li>Roland Nurier</li><li><em>Screenwriter:</em></li><li>Roland Nurier</li></ul><p><br></p>\",\"short_description\":\"Part of the London Palestine Film Festival 2025\",\"venue\":{},\"is_dated\":true,\"start_time\":\"2025-11-25T19:00:00.000Z\",\"end_time\":\"2025-12-12T21:00:00.000Z\",\"cutoff_event_watch_at_availability_end\":false,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"6212329f6ee92e007e8874e6\",